  "description": "Folk Horror is a subgenre of horror that is based around folklore and urban legends. Many stories of the genre would often center around a protagonist in lone rural areas, encountering malevolent entities. It is similar to Catholic Horror as it incorporates elements such as demons, cults and depictions of the devil, but focuses more on the supernatural and fear of the unknown.",
